01:05:46.142 --> 01:05:48.710
  <i> And Tex said,</i>                
  <i> "I'm the devil, and I'm here</i> 
  <i> to do the devil's business."</i> 

715
01:05:51.614 --> 01:05:53.014
      MANSON: <i> Believe me.</i>      

716
01:05:53.049 --> 01:05:55.150
<i> If I started murdering people,</i> 

717
01:05:56.352 --> 01:05:58.386
  <i> there'd be none of you left.</i> 

718
01:06:01.090 --> 01:06:03.358
      <i> Because my children</i>      
      <i> are coming.</i>
